title: onboarding
---
Siren of the Veiled Vale: Act I is onboarding. Follow mission objectives in the tracker, interact with ! markers, and use O if you lose the chain. Start worlds stay compact so you can learn quickly.
-> Launch the first trial
    <<fire_event siren_start_first_trial>>
    <<stop>>
-> Open mission board instead
    <<fire_event siren_open_mission_board>>
    <<stop>>
-> Repeat controls and tracking cues
    <<jump control_reminder>>
-> Understood. I'll return later
    <<fire_event siren_onboarding_complete>>
    <<stop>>
===
title: control_reminder
---
Siren of the Veiled Vale: Arrow Keys move, Z jumps, Left Shift runs, C dashes, X attacks, S guards/parries, and A switches Yin/Yang stance. TAB shows the map. F1 opens controls.
-> Launch the first trial
    <<fire_event siren_start_first_trial>>
    <<stop>>
-> Open mission board
    <<fire_event siren_open_mission_board>>
    <<stop>>
-> Back to briefing
    <<jump onboarding>>
===